<title>INDIA: India soybean, soyoil prices steady in light trade.</title>
<headline>India soybean, soyoil prices steady in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean prices were almost steady in central Indian markets on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Soyoil was steady in very thin trading as demand was poor.</p>
<p>Soymeal and rapeseed extraction prices were slightly down on poor export demand. Soymeal yellow was $319 per tonne FAS (free alongside ship) in bulk for export.</p>
<p>Rapeseed extraction was $118 per tonne FAS (free alongside ship) in bulk for export and was quoted at 4,100-4,150 rupees per tonne in FOR (free on rail) condition.</p>
